## PoC 生成完成

**VULN 001 — AP4_HvccAtom Off-by-One Heap OOB Read**：`VERIFIED_CRASH` ✓

### ASAN 报告摘要

```
==ERROR: AddressSanitizer: heap-buffer-overflow
READ of size 1 at ...  thread T0
  #0  AP4_HvccAtom::AP4_HvccAtom(unsigned int, unsigned char const*)
      Ap4HvccAtom.cpp:282   ← payload[22] OOB read
  #1  AP4_HvccAtom::Create(...)   ← size=30 传入

"0 bytes to the right of 22-byte region [0x..., 0x...)"
```

### 触发机制

| 关键点 | 值 |
|--------|-----|
| hvcC box size | `30`（= 8 header + 22 payload） |
| payload_size | `30 - 8 = 22` |
| 卫语句 `payload_size < 22` | `22 < 22` 为假，**绕过保护** |
| OOB 读取位置 | `payload[22]`（第 282 行） |
| ASAN 判定 | heap-buffer-overflow, READ 1 byte |

